y spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Pyre Hound.', 'Trample\\n{3}{G}: Target attacking Wolf or Werewolf gains indestructible until end of turn.', 'U', "Unimpeded Trespasser can't be blocked.", 'Untap target creature. It gets +2/+2 and gains reach until end of turn. (It can block creatures with flying.)', "Vigilance, trample\\nWerewolf of Ancient Hunger's power and toughness are each equal to the total number of cards in all players' hands.\\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if a player cast two or more spells last turn, transform Werewolf of Ancient Hunger.", 'W', 'When Byway Courier dies, investigate. (Put a colorless Clue artifact token onto the battlefield with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', 'When Drownyard Explorers enters the battlefield, investigate. (Put a colorless Clue artifact token onto the battlefield with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', 'When Drunau Corpse Trawler enters the battlefield, put a 2/2 black Zombie creature token onto the battlefield.\\n{2}{B}: Target Zombie gains deathtouch until end of turn.', 'When Fleeting Memories enters the battlefield, investigate. (Put a colorless Clue artifact token onto the battlefield with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\nWhenever you sacrifice a Clue, target player puts the top three cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.', "When Gibbering Fiend enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to each opponent.\\nDelirium — At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, Gibbering Fiend deals 1 damage to that player.", 'When Harvest Hand dies, return it to the battlefield transformed under your control.', 'When Inspiring Captain enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'When Lamplighter of Selhoff enters the battlefield, if you control another Zombie, you may draw a card. If you do, discard a card.', "When Manic Scribe enters the battlefield, each opponent puts the top three cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.\\nDelirium — At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, that player puts the top three cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.", "When Obsessive Skinner enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\nDelirium — At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.", 'When Rottenheart Ghoul dies, target player discards a card.', 'When Stoic Builder enters the battlefield, you may return target land card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Stromkirk Mentor enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on another target Vampire you control.', "When Thalia's Lieutenant enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each other Human you control.\\nWhenever another Human enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Thalia's Lieutenant.", 'When Thraben Inspector enters the battlefield, investigate. (Put a colorless Clue artifact token onto the battlefield with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', "When Tooth Collector enters the battlefield, target creature an opponent controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn.\\nDelirium — At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, target creature that player controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn.", "When this creature transforms into Awoken Horror, return all non-Horror creatures to their owners' hands.", 'When this creature transforms into Demon-Possessed Witch, you may destroy target creature.', 'When this creature transforms into Lunarch Inquisitors, you may exile another target creature until Lunarch Inquisitors leaves the battlefield.', 'When you sacrifice a Clue, transform Daring Sleuth.', 'Whenever Bloodmad Vampire deals combat damage to a player, put a +1/+1 counter on it.\\nMadness {1}{R} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', 'Whenever Briarbridge Patrol deals damage to one or more creatures, investigate. (Put a colorless Clue artifact token onto the battlefield with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\nAt the beginning of each end step, if you sacrificed three or more Clues this turn, you may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield.', 'Whenever Flameheart Werewolf blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, Flameheart Werewolf deals 2 damage to that creature.\\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if a player cast two or more spells last turn, transform Flameheart Werewolf.', 'Whenever Kessig Forgemaster blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, Kessig Forgemaster deals 1 damage to that creature.\\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if no spells were cast last turn, transform Kessig Forgemaster.', 'Whenever Pious Evangel or another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice another permanent: Transform Pious Evangel.', 'Whenever Wayward Disciple or another creature you control dies, target opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', "Whenever Wolf of Devil's Breach attacks, you may pay {1}{R} and discard a card. If you do, Wolf of Devil's Breach deals damage to target creature or planeswalker equal to the discarded card's converted mana cost.", 'Whenever a Werewolf enters the battlefield under your control, you may transform it.\\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if a player cast two or more spells last turn, transform Vildin-Pack Alpha.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield, if it entered from your graveyard or you cast it from your graveyard, return Prized Amalgam from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, investigate. (Put a colorless Clue artifact token onto the battlefield with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\nWhenever you sacrifice a Clue, put a +1/+1 counter on Tireless Tracker.', 'Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, investigate. (Put a colorless Clue artifact token onto the battlefield with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\nWhenever you sacrifice a Clue, put a 1/1 white Human Soldier creature token onto the battlefield.', 'Whenever a permanent you control transforms into a non-Human creature, put a 2/2 green Wolf creature token onto the battlefield.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell during your turn, draw a card.\\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if no spells were cast last turn, transform Hermit of the Natterknolls.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell during your turn, draw two cards.\\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if a player cast two or more spells last turn, transform Lone Wolf of the Natterknolls.', 'Whenever another creature you control dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Unruly Mob.', 'Whenever one or more creatures you control deal combat damage to a player, investigate. (Put a colorless Clue artifact token onto the battlefield with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\n{1}{G}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Investigate. You gain 2 life.', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, Cathar\'s Companion gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell from your hand, you may cast target card with the same name as that spell from your graveyard. (You still pay its costs.)', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, investigate. (Put a colorless Clue artifact token onto the battlefield with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', 'Whenever you sacrifice a Clue, you gain 3 life.', 'Woodland Stream enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U} to your mana pool.', 'You gain 5 life.', '{1}, Discard a card: Put a 1/1 black Vampire Knight creature token with lifelink onto the battlefield. Activate this ability only once each turn.', '{1}, Discard a card: Transform Elusive Tormentor.', '{1}, {T}: Put a charge counter on Brain in a Jar, then you may cast an instant or sorcery card with converted mana cost equal to the number of charge counters on Brain in a Jar from your hand without paying its mana cost.\\n{3}, {T}, Remove X charge counters from Brain in a Jar: Scry X.', '{1}{B}, Sacrifice Vessel of Malignity: Target opponent exiles two cards from his or her hand. Activate this ability only any time you could cast a sorcery.', '{1}{G}, Sacrifice Vessel of Nascency: Reveal the top four cards of your library. You may put an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card from among them into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard.', '{1}{G}: Return target basic land card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{1}{R}, Sacrifice Vessel of Volatility: Add {R}{R}{R}{R} to your mana pool.', '{1}{W}, Exile Dauntless Cathar from your graveyard: Put a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying onto the battlefield. Activate this ability only any time you could cast a sorcery.', '{2}: Put target card from your graveyard on the bottom of your library.', '{2}{B}, Discard two cards: Return Ghoulsteed from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', '{2}{B}: Return Sanitarium Skeleton from your graveyard to your hand.', '{2}{G}: Look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.\\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, if no spells were cast last turn, transform Duskwatch Recruiter.', '{2}{W}, Sacrifice Vessel of Ephemera: Put two 1/1 white Spirit creature tokens with flying onto the battlefield.', '{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Explosive Apparatus: Explosive Apparatus deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', "{3}{B}, Exile Ghoulcaller's Accomplice from your graveyard: Put a 2/2 black Zombie creature token onto the battlefield. Activate this ability only any time you could cast a sorcery.", '{3}{W}: Target Human gains double strike until end of turn.', '{5}{G}: Quilled Wolf gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', '{B}, Pay 1 life, Put the top card of your library into your graveyard, Discard a card, Sacrifice Sinister Concoction: Destroy target creature.', '{B}: Put the top card of your library into your graveyard.\\nDelirium — At the beginning of your end step, if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, transform Autumnal Gloom.', '{T}, Discard a card: Tap target creature.', '{T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', '{T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Transform Town Gossipmonger.', '{T}: Add {B} or {G} to your mana pool.\\nDelirium — Deathcap Cultivator has deathtouch as long as there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Warped Landscape: Search your library for a basic land card and put it onto the battlefield tapped. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{3}: Return Drownyard Temple from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{4}, {T}: Investigate. (Put a colorless Clue artifact token onto the battlefield with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{5}, {T}, Pay 1 life: Put a 1/1 white and black Human Cleric creature token onto the battlefield.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice five creatures: Transform Westvale Abbey, then untap it.', '{T}: Target player draws a card, then discards a card.', '{U}, Sacrifice Vessel of Paramnesia: Target player puts the top three cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard. Draw a card.']
